      <activity id="f765acd1-025e-546e-ae71-e1810c9cece5" activityNameId="2d06cee8-d66d-5bd2-9f4b-95babc31c029" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Open ground construction, on ground, Mont Soleil</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Open ground construction, on ground, Mont Soleil
Production of the additional components necessary for the mounting of 1 m2 PV panel or laminate.;
UUID: 18fe6ea6-07a5-317e-9eab-768ca570e159
Materials and packaging for the production and estimation for metal processing. Disposal of the product after use. Energy use for the construction process must be included in data of the PV-plant.
Location: Production in CH.
Technology: Construction parts for a photovoltaic system.
Time period: Date of data investigation.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from manufacturers 
Extrapolations: One open ground system installed in 1992 in Switzerland
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_18fe6ea6-07a5-317e-9eab-768ca570e159.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
